sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as user
  participant CL as claude (one session)
  participant TX as tmux
  participant BD as gogo board (readers)

  Note over U,BD: as-is - the binding is one string, minted once, never re-minted
  U->>CL: work on item alpha
  TX-->>BD: session name gogo-done-alpha
  BD-->>U: alpha shows a live session dot - CORRECT

  U->>CL: /gogo:done alpha
  CL->>BD: alpha state.md becomes shipped - card moves to the changelog column
  Note over TX: the ship-reap sweeps the member slugs but SPARES its own host pane
  TX-->>BD: the session is still called gogo-done-alpha
  BD-->>U: SYMPTOM 1 - a live session dot on a CHANGELOG card

  U->>CL: /gogo:plan beta        (same session, new work item)
  CL->>BD: .gogo/work/feature-beta/ appears
  BD-->>U: SYMPTOM 2 - beta shows NO session, though a claude is driving it

  Note over U,BD: both symptoms are the SAME stale string

  Note over U,BD: the only repair that exists today
  U->>BD: leave claude, open the gogo cockpit, find beta's card, press R
  BD->>BD: adopt picker over every live session - rename onto the focused card
  Note over BD: there is no screen that LISTS sessions, and no way to fix it from INSIDE
  Note over BD: 0.32.0 D2 - the cockpit has no item-level evidence, so it can never do this alone
